    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d461">

                <pb facs="0524" n="444" xml:id="pg444"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.00 Revolutions/139: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Bahia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Briggs</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bahia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-10-23T15:00:00-03:00">October 23, 1930—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:46 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Battle expected at Algoinhas. Rumored that Algoinhas was captured this morning.
                    British cruiser here. German cruiser outside. No news of <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Pensacola.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Briggs</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
